                        %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
                        %mi m
                        %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                      %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} L_{kin}(m)
          %p
            In this case the above statement of the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/main+theorem+of+perturbative+renormalization"} main theorem of perturbative renormalization
            implies with
            %a.maruku-eqref{:href => "#eq:SMatricesRelatedBySPRenormalizationGroupElement"} (1)
            that there exists a unique transformation
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %msubsup
